{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311050","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1231105001:1":{"text":"ラスティーアンカーは海運の要衝なので、各地の特産品がここに集まるんです！","source_cn":"锈锚港一直以来都是海运枢纽，各地的特色物产都会在这里交汇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB123943252A89F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231105002:1":{"text":"ヴェルディア連盟の花茶や荒涼の砂漠の毛皮、金麦村の麦……首都で作られる宝石のついた指輪も取り扱ったことがあるんですよ！","source_cn":"绿裔联盟的花茶，荒角沙漠的皮毛，金穗村的麦货……我甚至...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64AA16AD47FB5C94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231105003:1":{"text":"でも今は封鎖されてるせいで、そういうものが仕入れられないんです。","source_cn":"可如今锈锚港封锁，这些货物无法运入。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA259635F2E88EFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1231105004:1":{"text":"あぁ、爽やかな草木の香りがする花茶が恋しいよ。残念だなぁ……","source_cn":"我很想念花茶，有一股自然的草木清香。可惜呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FAA245785CFAB24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人梅妮吉":{"text":"商人のメニジェ","source":"商人梅妮吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:居民葛朗特":{"text":"住民のグラント","source":"居民葛朗特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}